{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioCfAccountPicker",
  "$description": "The Cloudflare account picker: which of the accounts this grant reaches should publishing and the assistant run against. A `jx-dialog`, so the platform owns modality, Escape, focus restoration and the backdrop — which is what retired the `sp-dialog-wrapper` this surface used to open by hand, along with the focus trap and the `aria-modal` slot `showDialog` wrapped around it. There is no confirming button: each row commits itself, because a picker whose answer is one of N rows has N answers rather than one. The adapter (`surfaces/cf-account-picker.ts`) hands in rows that are already strings and booleans — nothing here knows what `cf_account_required` is, which call refused, or whether the list came back empty because the grant reaches nothing or because Cloudflare could not be reached.",
  "tagName": "jx-dialog",
  "$props": {
    "headline": "Choose a Cloudflare account",
    "confirmLabel": "",
    "cancelLabel": "Cancel",
    "size": "sm"
  },
  "attributes": {
    "part": "cf-accounts"
  },
  "oncancel": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "onclose": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The picker's own look. Four `.cf-account-picker*` rules in `styles/shell.css` become the parts below and one of them does not come with them: `min-width: 320px` was this surface sizing its own box, and `jx-dialog` is what sizes a dialog now — `sm` is `min(90vw, 24rem)`, which is wider than the 320px it asked for. The row shape came from `.prefs-account`, which the lit template BORROWED from Preferences › Accounts; it is copied here rather than shared, because a class in a stylesheet is a thing two surfaces can drift apart on and `preferences-dialog.ts` still draws its own rows from it. Three token repairs travel with them: `--spectrum-font-size-75` and `--spectrum-font-size-50` resolve only inside `<sp-theme>`, and a document mounted in the dialog layer is outside it, so every one of them would silently have taken its hard-coded fallback.",
    "& [part=\"picker\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"intro\"], & [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The lede and the two absences read as the same secondary line, so they are one rule: the sentence over the list and the sentence drawn instead of it are the same voice.",
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"error\"]": {
      "$description": "A commit the broker refused, said above the list the reader is still looking at. It is not an announcement of the same thing twice: the list survives a refusal, because listing again is not what would fix an account Cloudflare will not accept, so the reason has to sit beside the rows that are still on offer.",
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"fail\"]": {
      "$description": "The one state that offers a verb of its own. Retrying is right for a listing that never landed and wrong for a grant that genuinely reaches nothing, so the button lives in this branch rather than under both.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "flex-start",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "justifyContent": "space-between",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)"
    },
    "& [part=\"text\"]": {
      "$description": "`min-width: 0` so a long account name ellipses inside the row instead of pushing its own button off the end of it.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"name\"]": {
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"detail\"]": {
      "$description": "The account id under the name. Two Cloudflare accounts may carry the same name and the id is what is stored, so the row shows both rather than the half a reader would have to guess from.",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "picker"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "p",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "intro"
          },
          "textContent": "Your Cloudflare login reaches more than one account. Publishing and the assistant both run against the one you pick; you can change it in Preferences › Accounts."
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "body-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/listState"
          },
          "cases": {
            "loading": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "Reading your Cloudflare accounts…"
            },
            "empty": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "This Cloudflare login reaches no accounts. Create one at dash.cloudflare.com, then try again."
            },
            "failed": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "fail"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.failureMessage}"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "retry"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "size": "sm"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/retry"
                        },
                        "value": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "Try again"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "listed": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "listed",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "error-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "display": "contents"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/hasFailure"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "true": {
                      "tagName": "p",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "error"
                      },
                      "textContent": "${state.failure}"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "list"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "$prototype": "Array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/rows"
                      },
                      "key": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                      },
                      "map": {
                        "tagName": "div",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "row",
                          "data-account": "${$map.item.id}"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "tagName": "div",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "text"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "name"
                                },
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.name}"
                              },
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "detail"
                                },
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.id}"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "jx-button",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "choose"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "size": "sm",
                              "variant": "accent",
                              "disabled": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/busy"
                              }
                            },
                            "onclick": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/choose"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
